*HEADING
A3: beam A (r 0.8, along x) clamped at both ends; free beam B (r 0.5, along y) above it with a 0.3 mm surface gap moves down at 2 m/s, hits A at mid-span and rebounds; linear elastic E0; frictionless contact using the beam radii
** Generated by abaqus/cases.py. Units: mm, N, s, tonne, MPa.
** Contact: general contact over all exterior (beam elements enter as circular-section edges). CHECK in the
** .sta/.msg that beam-beam contact was active (B must rebound, not pass through A). If not, the beam edges
** need to be included explicitly (edge-to-edge / feature-edge contact inclusion).
